<!--
    Files Noteapp hands to other apps through its FileProvider (PHASE-3.md). Cache folders only:
    never the notebooks themselves.
      camera/  - where the camera app saves a photo taken with Take Photo
      exports/ - exported PDFs, for Share (step 3.7)
-->
